# WebSocket commands — use a WS client connected to:
# ws://{{host}}/ws?token={{authToken}}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/ws
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## Automations over the WebSocket

  Editing goes over REST (see the other requests in this folder). The WebSocket carries what
  Companion needs, and what keeps every client in step.

  ### Commands (token required)

  ```json
  { "type": "automations.list" }
  { "type": "automations.run", "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }
  { "type": "automations.set_armed", "armed": false }
  ```

  - `automations.list` is answered by `automations.changed`.
  - `automations.run` runs the rule now (ignoring its cooldown, event check and the master switch)
    and answers `{ "type": "ok" }`, or `{ "type": "error", "message": "not_found" }`. The run
    arrives as `automation.run`.
  - `automations.set_armed` answers `ok`; `automations.changed` is broadcast.

  ### Broadcasts

  ```json
  { "type": "automations.changed", "armed": true, "automations": [ { "id": "…", "name": "Service start", … } ] }
  {
    "type": "automation.run",
    "run": {
      "id": "…", "automationId": "…", "name": "Service start",
      "cause": "Preset 3 finished on camera 1", "manual": false, "startedAt": "2026-10-07T08:00:00Z",
      "results": [
        { "action": "Move camera to preset 3", "outcome": "skipped", "message": "that preset is what fired the rule" },
        { "action": "Start OBS", "outcome": "done", "message": null },
        { "action": "Start ATEM", "outcome": "failed", "message": "atem_not_connected" }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  `automations.changed` is also sent when a client with the token connects. A run with a failure
  also sends `{ "type": "notification", "level": "warn", "message": "…" }`.

  ### Middle Control preset feedback

  `connector.state` for `middlecontrol` now carries `runningPreset` (1–12, or `null` at rest: the
  preset moving the selected camera) and `lastPreset` (`{ preset, cameraId, at }`: the last move
  Metocast watched run to its end). `presetMoveActive` is derived from `runningPreset`.
}
